<refentry version="5.1"
  xml:id="Api.SilikoTokenCopy"
  xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoTokenCopy</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoTokenCopy</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to copy a token</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Token.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">SilikoToken *SilikoTokenCopy(const SilikoToken *source);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoTokenCopy</function> function copies the value
of <varname>source</varname> into a new <type>SilikoToken</type>
object.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoTokenCopy</function> returns a pointer to the new
<type>SilikoToken</type> object if seccessful, <literal>NULL</literal>
otherwise.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
